message: >-
  Si utiliza este desarrollo 0.5.0.9003, cite su version y commit exactos.
  Todavia no tiene DOI de version. El DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24238726 identifica
  exclusivamente el archivo anterior 0.5.0.9000, separado del envio 0.5.0 a CRAN.
type: software
title: "fhirviews: FHIR desde R y vistas tabulares con SQL on FHIR"
version: 0.5.0.9003
authors:
  - family-names: "Salas Guerrero"
    given-names: "Ronald Fabricio"
    email: "fabriciosalasguerrero@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5077-1522"
repository-code: "https://github.com/f-slg/fhirviews"
url: "https://f-slg.github.io/fhirviews/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - SQL on FHIR
  - FHIRPath
  - R
  - interoperability
abstract: >-
  R client for FHIR R4 servers and SQL on FHIR view engine, with explicit
  mappings from SQL query results and R tables to Patient, Observation,
  Encounter, Condition, Immunization, Specimen and DiagnosticReport resources.
  Supports JSON and NDJSON output, decimal precision, R4 structural checks,
  an optional external Rust component and server profile validation.
